      "content": "i get that, but im tryin to be realistic. some people online say avoid certain parts of east or north london because they're \"too diverse\" or \"rough\" and have a lot of immigrant communities which makes them feel less safe for tourists. is there any truth to that or is it just people being biased? i just want to know if there's a connection between those types of neighborhoods and the crime rates i should be worried about.",
